    <system:String x:Key="Loc_a88e7354">Features &amp; Capabilities</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_e4567969">Smart System Capabilities &amp; Specifications – RoboVAI PRO POS v6.0</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_18c717be">An integrated cloud and local POS and warehouse system engineered with top-tier security and lightning speed</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_ab5fe0cf">Ultra-Fast Smart POS Terminal</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_618734c0">Smooth checkout interface supporting instant barcode scanning, quick shortcuts (F1-F12), held orders, and auto-tax &amp; discount calculations.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_50eec113">Floating Touch Numpad</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_42f218bd">Resizable floating numeric keypad designed for touchscreens to adjust quantities and prices with a single touch.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_ba2a5bb9">Gaming Lounge &amp; Canteen (Rentals)</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_6258a6cf">Manage PlayStation &amp; Billiards devices, support open and prepaid sessions, print time tickets, and merge canteen orders into billing.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_2ebe91af">Smart Inventory Audit &amp; Barcodes</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_2807516f">Interactive barcode auditing sessions, auto surplus/deficit calculations, inventory reconciliations, and barcode label printing in multiple sizes.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_306efd03">Sub-Cashier LAN Synchronization</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_defda1c1">Ultra-fast embedded local server on port 7890 to sync sub-registers with the main server in real-time without requiring internet.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_26a3c6ff">Smart Warehouse App (WMS PWA)</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_4d5ef5b2">Progressive Web App (PWA) running on mobile phones and tablets for stock auditing, receiving goods, and barcode scanning via QR bridge.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_92a3af0c">Cash Shifts &amp; Z/X Reports</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_8b75f5da">Cashier shift management, opening cash floats, expense tracking, surplus/deficit calculation, and comprehensive instant Z-Report printing.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_53bc7a84">Customer Loyalty &amp; Rewards Program</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_b5e76142">Automatic loyalty points per purchase, tier classifications (Silver, Gold, Platinum), and instant point redemption for discounts.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_a6cc947c">Purchasing &amp; Supplier Debt Management</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_9dd3e44d">Purchase order logging, supplier installment &amp; debt tracking, automated stock increases, and moving average cost calculation.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_576d8a05">Partial &amp; Full Sales Returns</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_a50c8970">Invoice returns by number, accurate tax and amount refunds, and automated restocking of returned goods.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_c1d9cdc1">Security &amp; Audit Log</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Loc_73ce4e3b">Granular logging of every action, edit, and deletion with username and timestamp to prevent tampering and safeguard store assets.</system:String>
